      "id": "claim_e09b15805ddf48cb870cd15539b9a2bb",
      "statement": "The Cybflight mission planner supports two compile-time schemas (plan_offline and plan_online), where plan_offline solves a precomputed schedule using a MINCO Snap banded LU solver in single-digit milliseconds, and plan_online runs an on-device trust-region BFGS optimizer in 1-iteration cooperative bursts with inter-burst delays to allow peer Embassy tasks to execute without CPU starvation.",
