      "statement": "The MincoSnapN solver formulates an 8N x 8N banded linear system with half-bandwidth 8 to solve degree-7 polynomial trajectories enforcing PVAJ head/tail boundaries and continuity up to derivative 6 (velocity through pop), while providing closed-form energy integrals and exact coefficient/time gradient backpropagation.",
