      "id": "claim_6f5c49f34056477eb98651b55700412f",
      "statement": "In online trajectory planning, intermediate waypoints are reparameterized onto a ball chart using a stereographic projection P_i = P_hat_i + (2 r D_i) / (||D_i||^2 + 1) with sanitized radius r >= 1e-4 m, bounding waypoint displacement while preserving smooth gradients for BFGS optimization.",
