      "statement": "The tracking NMPC SQP solver executes 1 iteration per 50 Hz control tick using a structured Riccati backward sweep that exploits sparse dynamics Jacobian blocks (BNZ_START/BNZ_LEN) and sparse state Jacobian columns (JAC_X_NZ_COL_START), employing an unrolled 4 x 4 Cholesky inverse with diagonal regularization.",
